  "worked_solution": "The complement of $E,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{E},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $E.$\n\nThe only elements of $U$ that are not in $E$ are $s,$ $t,$ $u,$ and $v.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $E$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{E}={s,t,u,v}.\n$$",
